  tags: [bugbash-iter7, implemented]
- label: validatePanelIds in src/config.ts reports duplicate panel IDs with context (the panel names that collided and whether explicit id or hash-derived) e.g. 'config: duplicate panel ID "xxx" (panels: "p1", "p2")' instead of just the ID
  command: cd /tmp && PACE_CONFIG=/tmp/pace-bad-dup-id.yaml bun run /tmp/harness-config-load.ts 2>&1 | grep -q 'duplicate panel ID "samehash" (panels:'
